Backs up the ZFS mirror to the 6TB array disk (tier 2 of 3). Runs every 30 min but no-ops unless today's backup is missing, because the server powers off when idle and would never be awake at a fixed nightly hour. Dumps Postgres with pg_dump, rsyncs from a dedicated ZFS snapshot, keeps dated restore points via --link-dest hardlinks. Retention 14 daily / 8 weekly / 6 monthly. Schedule: */30 * * * *
